    "en": {
      "trackName": "ZEN Watch Games",
      "description": "ZEN Watch Games is a calm Apple Watch puzzle game you play on your wrist.\n\nRotate and mirror glowing tiles to connect the twin stars in quick, calming sessions. Early levels are relaxing, while Perfect Flow challenges ask you to use every tile. Larger deep-flow puzzles add more thoughtful paths while staying easy to read and play. Endless random levels and adjustable difficulty keep the puzzle flow going.\n\nFeatures:\n• Apple Watch-first puzzle play\n• Simple tap and long-press tile controls\n• Perfect Flow levels that use every tile\n• Deep logic boards for short sessions\n• Relaxing neon visuals, sound, and haptics\n• Progress tracking and replay\n• Offline play with local progress storage\n• Music, sound, motion, and contrast controls\n\nNo account. No ads. Just a focused logic puzzle for quiet moments.",
      "releaseNotes": "Thanks for playing ZEN Tile Flow! We've freshened things up behind the scenes. Keep connecting the flow — calm, focused puzzles await on your wrist.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/zen-watch-games/id6773094129?uo=4",
      "formattedPrice": "Free",
      "sellerName": "YURY NICKOLAEVICH BREI",
